<p> Scrap	    24,440 (ULD)  1,977     C.Michalis	 23/10</p>
<p> Paper reels     2,299 (ULD)    158     Amar Devi	  23/10</p>
<p> Sugar	     5,175 (LDD)  4,825     Mamaia	     23/10</p>
